             \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F10A</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : the\nsignals proportional to the load return to pins 11 and 12; according\nto these signals the headlamp electronics automatically adjust the\nlight beam by means of a special motor. The left headlamp motor\nis adjusted directly, whilst the right one is adjusted via the serial\nline between \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F10A</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F11A</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The dipped headlamps control signal reaches \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F10A</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and \n\n                              \n                              \n        